        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "59190319-ffe6-5128-a209-ba3845550e09",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Neringa Municipality, Klaipėda County, Lithuania, Curonian Spit, Pervalka, Curonian Lagoon, Baltic Sea\n- Organizations: Municipalities of Lithuania\n- Systems: Lithuanian administrative divisions\n- Products: Pervalka Lighthouse\n\nFacts:\n- Lithuania is divided into 60 municipalities, and those municipalities are further divided into more than 500 elderships.\n- Neringa Municipality is a municipality in Klaipėda County in the westernmost part of Lithuania.\n- Neringa Municipality comprises several villages on the Curonian Spit.\n- Pervalka is administratively part of the city of Neringa.\n- Pervalka Lighthouse is located in Pervalka on the Curonian Spit in Lithuania.\n- Pervalka Lighthouse stands between the Curonian Lagoon to the east and the Baltic Sea to the west.",
